WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }
::cue(c.colora8c7fa) { color: #a8c7fa; }
::cue(c.credits) { color: #a8c7fa; font-size: 78%; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Premium</c></b>
Keep the project alive: <c.colora8c7fa>ko-fi.com/not6ip</c>

2
00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:30.650
Every time I look up to the sky after the rain

3
00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:36.160
I think back to when I was a crybaby

4
00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:43.900
I was chasing somebody's back blindly

5
00:00:43.970 --> 00:00:46.880
Thinking "I want to be stronger"

6
00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:52.060
The word "thank you" has faded into the wind now

7
00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:57.240
Am I getting stronger?

8
00:00:57.440 --> 00:01:02.910
I don't know the answer yet

9
00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:08.430
That's why I'll keep walking ahead

10
00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:11.060
So let's go

11
00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:14.270
Without stopping

12
00:01:14.270 --> 00:01:19.510
Without giving up to the flow of time

13
00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:25.120
I'll keep getting back up

14
00:01:25.130 --> 00:01:30.760
Because I don't want to lose something precious

15
00:01:30.770 --> 00:01:35.880
The voice inside of me

16
00:01:35.890 --> 00:01:41.280
keeps sustaining me

17
00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:46.410
Wicked rain will get in my way

18
00:01:46.420 --> 00:01:51.350
But I won't walk away

19
00:01:54.450 --> 00:01:56.810
So let's go

20
00:01:56.810 --> 00:02:00.090
Without stopping

21
00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:05.380
Without giving up to the flow of time

22
00:02:05.390 --> 00:02:11.020
I'll keep getting back up

23
00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:16.380
Because I don't want to lose something precious

24
00:02:16.390 --> 00:02:22.080
To the future I believe in...

25
00:02:40.440 --> 00:02:47.350
<b>Edward Newgate</b>

26
00:02:47.410 --> 00:02:49.580
You got to be kidding me!

27
00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:04.360
Ace...!

28
00:03:10.060 --> 00:03:11.370
Ace!

29
00:03:41.660 --> 00:03:46.970
Ace!

30
00:03:55.900 --> 00:03:58.250
Fire Fist Ace is dead!

31
00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:18.240
Straw Hat-boy!

32
00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:20.870
He's losing it!

33
00:04:21.510 --> 00:04:23.680
His life is in danger!

34
00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:37.860
It's Akainu!

35
00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:42.190
I'll get you this time for sure!

36
00:04:44.920 --> 00:04:47.360
Straw Hat!

37
00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:59.180
I'm not gonna let you kill him!

38
00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:04.080
Luffy-kun! Luffy-kun! Stay with me!

39
00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:06.690
Move out of my way!

40
00:05:12.480 --> 00:05:15.960
This war is not over yet!

41
00:05:17.800 --> 00:05:21.270
Take Ace's brother with you, Jinbe!

42
00:05:21.270 --> 00:05:22.840
All right!

43
00:05:23.660 --> 00:05:27.610
Straw Hat's life is how
Ace's life will live on!

44
00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:30.940
Commander... Marco!

45
00:05:35.950 --> 00:05:39.920
We will protect him at any
cost on Ace's behalf!

46
00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:42.950
If we let him die,

47
00:05:44.160 --> 00:05:48.690
it'll be a dishonor to the Whitebeard Pirates!

48
00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:57.840
Luffy-kun, don't lose your sanity!

49
00:05:59.640 --> 00:06:04.140
I told you that I won't
let the brothers get away!

50
00:06:10.350 --> 00:06:12.650
Straw Hat!

51
00:06:14.950 --> 00:06:15.790
Akainu-san!

52
00:07:00.030 --> 00:07:01.730
Pops is furious!

53
00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:03.770
Guys, we gotta get out of here!

54
00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:28.440
Hellhound!

55
00:07:32.500 --> 00:07:33.700
Pops!

56
00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:12.900
Navy HQ is collapsing!

57
00:09:23.480 --> 00:09:26.010
You bastard!

58
00:09:29.820 --> 00:09:32.960
Whitebeard!

59
00:09:36.280 --> 00:09:38.690
Admiral Sakazuki!

60
00:09:42.890 --> 00:09:45.200
– Don't fall!
– Hang on!

61
00:10:09.220 --> 00:10:10.790
Is it over?

62
00:10:13.140 --> 00:10:14.720
Pops!

63
00:10:19.060 --> 00:10:23.970
The plaza has split in two! The
pirates are on the other side!

64
00:10:25.570 --> 00:10:29.070
We are completely separated from Pops!

65
00:10:29.070 --> 00:10:31.020
Pops!

66
00:10:32.980 --> 00:10:36.950
He is still this powerful after his gut has been burnt through?

67
00:10:42.260 --> 00:10:44.160
I'm not done yet.

68
00:10:50.930 --> 00:10:54.530
Everybody, get on the ships!

69
00:10:54.530 --> 00:10:55.640
Pops!

70
00:10:55.640 --> 00:11:01.970
Think about why Pops stayed over there and his last wish for us!

71
00:11:01.970 --> 00:11:04.440
Cry after you get on the ship!

72
00:11:04.440 --> 00:11:08.280
– Pops! Ace!
– Hurry up!

73
00:11:11.440 --> 00:11:15.950
Bring all able ships to the bay!

74
00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:19.200
We won't let you get away!

75
00:11:20.090 --> 00:11:22.290
Hurry up, everyone!

76
00:11:27.030 --> 00:11:30.620
Salome! I can't stop worrying about Luffy!

77
00:11:34.370 --> 00:11:37.310
Hey, look! What is that?!

78
00:11:39.020 --> 00:11:42.080
There is something behind the HQ building!

79
00:11:42.080 --> 00:11:44.780
Oh, they found me!

80
00:11:44.780 --> 00:11:48.490
Not only him! Who are they on the scaffold?

81
00:11:49.580 --> 00:11:53.190
Oh... They noticed us finally.

82
00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:56.600
It's you! How did you all get here?!

83
00:11:58.280 --> 00:12:00.930
Why are they here?!

84
00:12:02.420 --> 00:12:05.640
You bastard.

85
00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:09.260
They're the most heinous criminals

86
00:12:09.260 --> 00:12:13.610
whose existence has been erased
because of their brutality!

87
00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:18.420
He's the biggest of all living things!

88
00:12:18.420 --> 00:12:22.200
The Pirate – "Colossal Battleship" Sanjuan Wolf!

89
00:12:21.470 --> 00:12:26.890
<b>"Colossal Battleship" Sanjuan Wolf</b>

90
00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:26.890
Oh, not only am I found,
but they know who I am!

91
00:12:27.320 --> 00:12:30.580
"Corrupt King" Avalo Pizarro!

92
00:12:29.030 --> 00:12:33.600
<b>"Corrupt King" Avalo Pizarro</b>

93
00:12:30.580 --> 00:12:33.600
I missed being back on the street!

94
00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:36.660
"Heavy Drinker" Vasco Shot!

95
00:12:38.370 --> 00:12:46.070
<b>"Heavy Drinker" Vasco Shot</b>

96
00:12:43.800 --> 00:12:46.080
Am I allowed to kill them all?

97
00:12:46.500 --> 00:12:49.610
"Crescent Moon Hunter" Catarina Devon!

98
00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:54.550
<b>"Crescent Moon Hunter" Catarina Devon</b>

99
00:12:51.520 --> 00:12:54.550
I like you boys, too.

100
00:12:55.060 --> 00:12:58.700
And the Head Jailer of Impel Down...

101
00:12:55.650 --> 00:13:00.560
<b>Shiryuu of the Rain</b>

102
00:12:58.700 --> 00:13:00.560
Shiryuu of the Rain!

103
00:13:01.140 --> 00:13:03.260
They're the Blackbeard Pirates!

104
00:13:08.840 --> 00:13:14.180
Long time no see! I'm glad to be
present at the time of your death!

105
00:13:14.180 --> 00:13:15.940
Pops!

106
00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:18.910
Teach...!

107
00:13:33.360 --> 00:13:36.290
Shiryuu! You...

108
00:13:37.560 --> 00:13:42.270
What happened to Magellan? What happened to Impel Down?!

109
00:13:43.360 --> 00:13:46.540
How did you all get here?!

110
00:13:48.140 --> 00:13:52.980
Doesn't the fact that we are here answer your questions...

111
00:13:52.980 --> 00:13:55.850
Fleet Admiral Sengoku-san?

112
00:13:59.640 --> 00:14:01.740
If you want to know the details...

113
00:14:01.740 --> 00:14:04.760
you can go find out for yourself later.

114
00:14:04.760 --> 00:14:08.200
At any rate, I've decided to team up with these guys.

115
00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:09.890
I bid you farewell.

116
00:14:13.640 --> 00:14:15.370
Fleet Admiral Sengoku!

117
00:14:16.280 --> 00:14:19.120
I didn't have a chance to report this to you earlier...

118
00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:25.100
But we received reports that the
Gates of Justice had opened again...

119
00:14:25.100 --> 00:14:27.850
and an unauthorized warship passed through it!

120
00:14:28.520 --> 00:14:31.140
And these people were on that ship?

121
00:14:31.140 --> 00:14:34.060
But there shouldn't be anyone in the control room except our marines...

122
00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:37.020
and nothing out of the ordinary has been reported, either!

123
00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:40.020
How did they get here?

124
00:14:41.800 --> 00:14:43.360
I apologize.

125
00:14:44.660 --> 00:14:46.770
It is quite simple.

126
00:14:47.120 --> 00:14:52.140
Before the Blackbeard Pirates set sail for Impel Down,

127
00:14:52.140 --> 00:14:56.640
I hypnotized the marines in the control room...

128
00:14:57.100 --> 00:14:59.480
and gave them the order that all warships approaching the Gates of Justice...

129
00:14:59.480 --> 00:15:01.250
were to be allowed to pass.

130
00:15:02.100 --> 00:15:05.920
It seems this helped some others as well.

131
00:15:06.260 --> 00:15:09.860
For a pirate, an enemy of the Government...

132
00:15:09.860 --> 00:15:14.190
breaking into Impel Down would've been impossible, since the Gates of Justice would never open.

133
00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:18.940
That's why I increased my reputation and became one of the Seven Warlords!

134
00:15:18.940 --> 00:15:21.530
But I don't need that rank any more!

135
00:15:23.940 --> 00:15:27.370
So your goal was to free those guys?

136
00:15:29.580 --> 00:15:32.010
Indeed! That was my plan all along!

137
00:15:32.010 --> 00:15:34.780
That was all I wanted!

138
00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:37.750
Now do you get it?

139
00:15:50.030 --> 00:15:53.150
None of that matters!

140
00:15:57.700 --> 00:16:00.370
Teach!

141
00:16:06.180 --> 00:16:08.050
Watch out, Captain!

142
00:16:28.580 --> 00:16:30.600
That was really close!

143
00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:33.170
We barely made it out in time.

144
00:16:45.460 --> 00:16:47.860
You aren't holding back!

145
00:16:47.860 --> 00:16:49.520
Well, I guess that's to be expected.

146
00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:57.450
You're the one person I will never call my son, Teach.

147
00:16:59.780 --> 00:17:06.020
You broke the one iron rule on my ship...

148
00:17:06.020 --> 00:17:08.840
You killed a member of the crew!

149
00:17:09.260 --> 00:17:12.610
So that the Fourth Division Commander Thatch may rest in peace...

150
00:17:13.020 --> 00:17:18.580
I will take this fool's life, and settle the score!

151
00:17:20.660 --> 00:17:21.840
Pops!

152
00:17:23.400 --> 00:17:26.400
Marco!

153
00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:29.090
Pops!

154
00:17:33.600 --> 00:17:36.800
Stay out of this!

155
00:17:36.800 --> 00:17:38.400
Pops!

156
00:17:38.940 --> 00:17:40.800
You got that?!

157
00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:48.680
Let's settle this, Teach!

158
00:17:50.980 --> 00:17:53.320
Fine by me!

159
00:18:03.630 --> 00:18:06.970
What is that black stuff coming out of his body?

160
00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:09.030
Smoke?

161
00:18:25.240 --> 00:18:27.140
Black Hole!

162
00:18:37.480 --> 00:18:42.930
This is the power of the Devil Fruit I stole after killing Thatch!

163
00:18:42.930 --> 00:18:47.180
The mightiest power, the Dark-Dark Fruit!

164
00:18:47.180 --> 00:18:50.940
Have a good taste!

165
00:18:53.010 --> 00:18:58.650
Hey, Pops. Thatch is dead, and so is Ace.

166
00:18:59.440 --> 00:19:04.000
I had always respected and admired you from the bottom of my heart.

167
00:19:04.000 --> 00:19:05.960
But now, you've grown old.

168
00:19:05.960 --> 00:19:10.190
So rusty, you couldn't save a single underling from execution!

169
00:19:10.620 --> 00:19:15.700
Even though I made sure to let Ace live after our battle on Banaro Island.

170
00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:19.940
That bastard...

171
00:19:20.770 --> 00:19:23.910
Now, now... That won't work.

172
00:19:24.060 --> 00:19:28.050
All Devil Fruit abilities are useless against me!

173
00:19:35.260 --> 00:19:37.320
Black Vortex!

174
00:19:43.040 --> 00:19:46.200
Well, Pops? What do you think about my darkness?

175
00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:51.540
It can even suck in Devil Fruit powers, making the users defenseless!

176
00:19:52.270 --> 00:19:55.610
In other words, you can't cause your earthquakes anym—

177
00:20:06.360 --> 00:20:07.720
That hurts...

178
00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:09.490
That hurts, damn it!

179
00:20:12.990 --> 00:20:15.620
Overconfidence... Carelessness...

180
00:20:15.620 --> 00:20:17.740
Those are your biggest weaknesses!

181
00:20:22.040 --> 00:20:23.770
S-Stop it...

182
00:20:24.340 --> 00:20:28.110
Pops, stop it! I'm your son, aren't I?

183
00:20:28.740 --> 00:20:30.510
Are you really going to kill me?!

184
00:20:49.230 --> 00:20:51.900
You did it, Pops!

185
00:20:54.700 --> 00:20:56.800
No... Look at that!

186
00:21:26.880 --> 00:21:30.060
Y-You monster!

187
00:21:33.870 --> 00:21:35.810
You should be dead!

188
00:21:37.240 --> 00:21:40.710
Can't you just die already?!

189
00:21:48.480 --> 00:21:50.490
Pops!

190
00:21:53.720 --> 00:21:58.260
Kill him, you guys!

191
00:22:22.600 --> 00:22:25.590
Do it! Turn him into a honeycomb!

192
00:22:32.000 --> 00:22:36.700
Pops!

193
00:22:43.500 --> 00:22:47.040
You're dying, you say, Roger?

194
00:22:47.040 --> 00:22:50.750
Yeah. I don't have much time left.

195
00:22:53.150 --> 00:22:58.440
Shall I tell you how to get to Raftel, Whitebeard?

196
00:22:58.440 --> 00:23:02.190
Even if you did, I wouldn't go. I'm not interested.

197
00:23:05.880 --> 00:23:11.200
Do you know what the Government calls me these days?

198
00:23:12.700 --> 00:23:14.810
"Gold Roger."

199
00:23:15.920 --> 00:23:19.810
What? Is that your real name?

200
00:23:19.810 --> 00:23:22.300
No, it's not.

201
00:23:22.300 --> 00:23:26.020
My name is Gol D. Roger.

202
00:23:26.020 --> 00:23:29.920
I've met some of those guys
with "D" in their names myself.

203
00:23:34.980 --> 00:23:37.960
There's one in my crew too. His name is Teach.

204
00:23:39.100 --> 00:23:41.730
What's with that "D" anyway?

205
00:23:45.140 --> 00:23:46.500
You want to know?

206
00:23:50.380 --> 00:23:52.880
Alright, I'll tell you.

207
00:23:55.980 --> 00:23:58.500
It's a story from long ago...

208
00:24:05.620 --> 00:24:08.690
I'm out of bullets.
Hey, someone give me another gun!

209
00:24:08.690 --> 00:24:11.200
It's not you...

210
00:24:11.200 --> 00:24:13.930
You're still alive?!

211
00:24:17.040 --> 00:24:20.700
The man Roger is waiting for...

212
00:24:20.700 --> 00:24:23.480
at the very least, Teach...

213
00:24:23.480 --> 00:24:25.880
it's definitely not you.

214
00:24:27.360 --> 00:24:31.450
Just like there are those who carry on Roger's will...

215
00:24:32.400 --> 00:24:38.640
I'm sure someone will appear to carry on Ace's will, someday.

216
00:24:38.640 --> 00:24:44.900
Even if you extinguish his bloodline, there's no way that their flame will ever burn out.

217
00:24:44.900 --> 00:24:51.330
It has been passed down since ancient times...

218
00:24:53.140 --> 00:24:57.380
And in the future... someday...

219
00:24:57.380 --> 00:25:02.520
someone will appear, shouldering the
burden of history for all those centuries,

220
00:25:02.520 --> 00:25:08.000
and challenge the whole world to a fight.

221
00:25:09.060 --> 00:25:11.240
Sengoku...

222
00:25:11.240 --> 00:25:14.760
You and the World Government...

223
00:25:14.760 --> 00:25:24.740
all fear the coming war and the immense impact it will have worldwide.

224
00:25:26.940 --> 00:25:29.300
I don't care myself...

225
00:25:30.460 --> 00:25:34.280
but as soon as someone finds that great treasure...

226
00:25:34.840 --> 00:25:38.180
the entire world will be turned upside down.

227
00:25:38.880 --> 00:25:41.520
And someone will find it.

228
00:25:42.900 --> 00:25:46.460
That day will definitely come sooner or later.

229
00:25:54.770 --> 00:25:57.470
One Piece...

230
00:25:58.740 --> 00:26:01.470
does exist!

231
00:26:11.520 --> 00:26:13.380
Damn you!

232
00:26:18.460 --> 00:26:20.660
Those are some magnificent last words!

233
00:26:22.420 --> 00:26:26.500
Forgive me... my sons...

234
00:26:27.260 --> 00:26:32.940
I'm responsible for one hell of a fool...

235
00:26:32.940 --> 00:26:38.140
But thanks to all of you, I had everything I ever wanted.

236
00:26:40.920 --> 00:26:44.580
This is the end for me.

237
00:26:50.500 --> 00:26:55.130
Now, that's odd! A pirate who doesn't care about treasure?

238
00:26:55.130 --> 00:26:58.080
What do you want, then?

239
00:26:59.860 --> 00:27:01.700
Hey, Newgate!

240
00:27:03.400 --> 00:27:08.170
There's one thing I've wanted, ever since I was a kid.

241
00:27:08.170 --> 00:27:10.690
Oh, there is?

242
00:27:10.690 --> 00:27:11.910
Tell us!

243
00:27:20.240 --> 00:27:22.360
A family.

244
00:27:23.690 --> 00:27:27.360
A family? What's that supposed to mean?

245
00:27:29.880 --> 00:27:32.200
I'm grateful to you.

246
00:27:33.400 --> 00:27:37.780
Farewell, my sons.

247
00:27:56.820 --> 00:28:00.970
H-He died...

248
00:28:00.970 --> 00:28:02.660
while still standing!

249
00:28:04.160 --> 00:28:08.130
Whitebeard is dead.

250
00:28:24.160 --> 00:28:29.320
Even in death, his body did not fall.

251
00:28:29.320 --> 00:28:33.640
His body, striking down foes while riddled with wounds...

252
00:28:33.640 --> 00:28:35.960
was truly monstrous.

253
00:28:42.880 --> 00:28:45.660
The total number of sword wounds he received in this battle...

254
00:28:45.660 --> 00:28:49.680
was 267.

255
00:28:49.680 --> 00:28:54.040
He was shot by 152 bullets.

256
00:28:54.040 --> 00:28:57.450
And was hit by 46 cannonballs.

257
00:29:00.100 --> 00:29:01.920
And despite all this...

258
00:29:02.550 --> 00:29:05.660
his proud back...

259
00:29:06.660 --> 00:29:11.160
over the course of his entire life as a pirate...

260
00:29:11.160 --> 00:29:15.740
never received a single scar from running away!

261
00:29:27.290 --> 00:29:38.940
<b>In memory of Kinryu Arimoto</b>

262
00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:30.410 line:8% position:5% align:start size:45%
<c.credits>Editing, Sewil</c>

